{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Criminal: Blood On Your Hands refuses travel teleports and summons but not Blink (#9132)",
  "contract": [
    "Issue #9132. The 9930873 tooltip says its bearer cannot retreat using teleport spells or hearthstones, and",
    "the PR author's ruling (2026-11-25) blocks every travel teleport, vanity items included, while combat",
    "movement stays. Hearthstone 8690 (SPELL_EFFECT_TELEPORT_UNITS to the home bind) and Teleport: Stormwind 3561",
    "(to a spell_target_position) fail silently (SPELL_FAILED_DONT_REPORT, 27) and leave the Criminal in place;",
    "as in original Ascension footage the PR author reviewed on 2026-11-25, the player is told 'You cannot escape",
    "while the No Retreat debuff is active!' (SMSG_NOTIFICATION) for every refused teleport; an accepted Call To",
    "Arms 804723 summon and a group member's Portal to Stormwind (gameobject 176296, Portal Effect 17334 cast by",
    "its user on itself) and CoA's Homebound Portal (item 97758, gameobject 80775, spell 93187: a dummy effect",
    "that teleports to the owner's hearth) do not move it (the same summon, accepted again once Criminal is",
    "lifted, does); Blink 1953 (a leap, not a fixed-destination teleport) is cast without a failure. Once",
    "Criminal is removed, Teleport: Stormwind lands at its target x -9003.46."
  ],
